    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes surface underway, chemical, meteorological and physical data collected during the CCGS Amundsen 2016 Green Edge cruise AN1601 (ArcticNet Leg 1, EXPOCODE 18DL20160603) in Baffin Bay from 2016-06-03 to 2016-07-10. These data include partial pressure of CO2 (pCO2), fugacity of CO2 (fCO2), mol fraction of CO2 (xCO2), sea surface salinity and sea surface temperature.",
